    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As the innkeeper of a magical roadside haven, your job is to host wandering adventurers, send them on quests, and sell them everything they need to survive the wilds. Manage rooms, serve buff-granting ales, and run a magical item shop stocked with potions, weapons, scrolls, and enchanted oddities.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udecf\ufe0f <strong>Manage your fantasy inn</strong> \u2013 Host heroes, build custom rooms, set prices, and deal with strange guest requests.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83e\uddd9 <strong>Assign quests</strong> \u2013 Choose adventurers, equip them, and send them off. Success depends on their gear, traits, and your preparation.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83e\uddea <strong>Run a magical shop</strong> \u2013 Sell potions, weapons, scrolls, charms, and rare loot.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udf7a <strong>Serve buff-granting ales</strong> \u2013 Each drink influences an adventurer\u2019s performance on their next quest.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2694\ufe0f <strong>Roguelite outcomes</strong> \u2013 Heroes can return victorious, cursed, missing... or worse.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfd7\ufe0f <strong>Upgrade and expand</strong> \u2013 Unlock new factions, d\u00e9cor, features, and world events.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As the innkeeper of a magical roadside haven, your job is to host wandering adventurers, send them on quests, and sell them everything they need to survive the wilds. Manage rooms, serve buff-granting ales, and run a magical item shop stocked with potions, weapons, scrolls, and enchanted oddities.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udecf\ufe0f <strong>Manage your fantasy inn</strong> \u2013 Host heroes, build custom rooms, set prices, and deal with strange guest requests.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83e\uddd9 <strong>Assign quests</strong> \u2013 Choose adventurers, equip them, and send them off. Success depends on their gear, traits, and your preparation.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83e\uddea <strong>Run a magical shop</strong> \u2013 Sell potions, weapons, scrolls, charms, and rare loot.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udf7a <strong>Serve buff-granting ales</strong> \u2013 Each drink influences an adventurer\u2019s performance on their next quest.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2694\ufe0f <strong>Roguelite outcomes</strong> \u2013 Heroes can return victorious, cursed, missing... or worse.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfd7\ufe0f <strong>Upgrade and expand</strong> \u2013 Unlock new factions, d\u00e9cor, features, and world events.</p>",
